    "text_full": "Skip to main content\nLaws of Software Engineering\nNEWSLETTER\nINFO\nBOOK\nPOSTER\n← Back to Laws\nTech World With Milan Newsletter\n\nI help 50,000+ engineers level up, one idea at a time.\n\nThe laws on this site come from years of writing about software engineering. Every week, I explore these ideas in depth with real-world examples and practical applications.\n\nWeekly insights on:\n\nSoftware engineering patterns and principles\nTech leadership and team dynamics\nCareer growth for engineers\n\nRead by staff/principal engineers, CTOs, and builders at top companies.\n\nArchive\n\nBrowse all past issues and find topics that interest you.\n\nView All Issues\n\nA collection of principles and patterns that shape software systems, teams, and decisions.\n\n© 2026 Dr. Milan Milanović · License · Privacy\n\nNewsletter\nInfo\nBook\nPoster"
